{"default":{"tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.0.grammar.0.vi":"Sentence pattern expressing a liking for something (to like ~).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.0.vi":"Do you all like \"travel (※1)\"?","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.0.vocab.0.vi":"everyone, all of you","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.0.vocab.1.vi":"travel, trip, journey","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.0.vocab.2.vi":"liked, favorite, fond of","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.grammar.0.vi":"Indicates a natural, inevitable condition: whenever/when doing this action, the subsequent event happens.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.grammar.1.vi":"Lists representative actions combined with the potential form (can do things like ~ and ~).","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vi":"When you travel, you can go to various places, see unusual things, and eat delicious food.","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.0.vi":"travel, trip, journey","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.1.vi":"when doing, upon doing","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.10.vi":"eating","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.11.vi":"can do, be able to","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.2.vi":"various, a variety of","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.3.vi":"place, location","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.4.vi":"go, going","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.5.vi":"rare, unusual, novel","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.6.vi":"thing, object","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.7.vi":"watching, seeing","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.1.vocab.9.vi":"thing, item","tests.0.skills.2.sections.0.passages.0.sentences.10.vi":"(*1) 旅: Travel (trip)","tests.0.skills.2.sectio